    {
      "decision": "交付物是供开发者自行测试的真实源码，不参与 Launchdeck 评分或评估。",
      "id": "D-001",
      "source": "approved discussion MP-001"
    },
    {
      "decision": "样例集合固定为十个批准项目，不允许规划阶段替换、合并或缩减。",
      "id": "D-002",
      "source": "approved discussion MP-002"
    },
    {
      "decision": "样例目录保持 Launchdeck 中立；Launchdeck 说明集中在 gallery 层，兼容验证使用外部夹具。",
      "id": "D-003",
      "source": "approved discussion MP-003/MP-009"
    },
    {
      "decision": "用户入口仅为 example list 与 example copy；显式 ID 面向脚本，TTY 可搜索选择面向人类。",
      "id": "D-004",
      "source": "approved discussion MP-004/MP-005"
    },
    {
      "decision": "复制采用目标父目录内同文件系统 staging + atomic rename；任何已存在目标均拒绝，以满足已批准的非空目标保护并保持 Windows/Linux 一致的无覆盖语义。",
      "id": "D-005",
      "source": "approved discussion MP-006/CA-003 plus safe cross-platform specification default"
    },
    {
      "decision": "npm 实包快照和 5/20 MiB 阈值、Windows/Linux 原生矩阵均为发布门禁。",
      "id": "D-006",
      "source": "approved discussion MP-007/MP-008"
